   "textKind": "explain",
   "content": "**Adults aged 25 and over have 14.3 years of schooling on average in Germany, the most, and 1.6 in Mali, the fewest.** The US averages 14 years, China 8 and India 7.3.\n\nThe fewest years of schooling:\n\n- **Mali:** 1.6 years (2020)\n- **Somalia:** 1.9 years (2022)\n- **Burkina Faso:** 2.3 years (2021)\n- **Afghanistan:** 2.5 years (2022)\n- **Benin:** 3.2 years (2021)\n\nThe map uses each country's latest figure from 2020–2026; blank countries have none. Source: UIS, November 2026 release; indicator MYS.1T8.AG25T99.",
